INSERT INTO `Comics` VALUES (1,1,NULL,NULL,'001_the_funny_guy.png','The Funny Guy','Funny Guy Dude Ash is dumb. Why is Ash dumb? No! No! Ash is fine! You just said he\'s dumb. No! Ash from a volcano hit my Magikarp, now look at it!!! Karp I guess it\'s ready for the deli counter. Uh-oh The Funny Guy\'s burning off again! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1151,1,1),(2,2,NULL,NULL,'002_foulness.png','Foulness','Why is it so stinky here! Well, Mayor McMonkey\'s lovely wife, Stinky... and well','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1347,1,1),(3,3,NULL,NULL,'003_hungry.png','Hungry','I\'m hungry A hot dog? STREACH! EKANS! Mommy! EKANS! CRACK!!! EK! Hello! What planet am I on? Earth Earth to Funny Guy! Hey, Fishead! I\'m Misty! Wow! Hey! I\'ll take that! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1589,1,1),(4,4,NULL,NULL,'004_pottyps_disco_club.png','Potty-P\'s Disco Club','Potty-P\'s Disco Club TONIGHT What\'s this? He noticed a sign and read it... Hmm. Beer Soda & Stuff Wow! A disco! No-duh This is cool! I\'d like 100 piece hot wings May I take your order? New! 10c a bottle Spicy Hot You\'re brave... my name\'s Potty-P. Whack! I\'m never going back! To be continued...','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1573,1,1),(5,5,NULL,NULL,'005_hot_sauce.png','Hot Sauce','That hot sauce gave me a hot butt. Hot sauce makes your butt on fire No wonder... AAAAA! Screeeeech! NO! Plasma Nitro Haleghluja! Potty-P\'s Disco Club Not again! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1331,1,1),(6,6,NULL,NULL,'006_food_eatin.png','Food Eatin\'','Where\'s the kid? Oh, he died. Drinks? Only soda. I didn\'t realize you ate so much. Potty-P\'s Disco Club What can I do to make a dinner? Yes! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1384,1,1),(7,7,NULL,NULL,'007_piece_of_junk.png','Piece of Junk','Snap! BIG BUTT SO WHAT Piece of junk! Junk! Junk!! Junk!!! BONK! BANG! Fix\'d! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1585,1,1),(8,8,NULL,NULL,'008_his_car.png','His Car','Ahh... that went well... My car... Pt pt pt BOOM! Ahhh!!! Piece of junk! Kick Yeeeooww!!! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1633,1,1),(9,9,NULL,NULL,'009_employees_only.png','Employees Only','That was a stupid car. Potty-P\'s Disco Club Closed I wonder what\'s going on? Hello? Employees Only Please Don\'t Come In Hmm... Ahhh!!! Shake it out! Big butt, so what! Snap! Crack! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1526,1,1),(10,10,NULL,NULL,'010_sadistic_little_kid.png','Sadistic Little Kid','Piece of Junk! Slice! Ka-boom! Uh-oh... Piece of junk! Mommy! Why are you laughing? My daddy farted and blew up the house! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1537,1,1),(11,11,NULL,NULL,'011_forest_traps.png','Forest Traps','Ahh... a great day...Grrr... Get me down you... Bang! Fart FART KA-BOOM! Dead leaves Wood FART HEELLLPP! (3 ft.) The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1761,1,1),(12,12,NULL,NULL,'012_tree_troubles.png','Tree Troubles','Potty-P\'s Disco Club Crack! BANG! Funny Guy Doll Real guy) Piece of Junk! Throw Bang! You dweeb! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1423,1,1),(13,13,NULL,NULL,'013_crap_man.png','Crap Man','Funny Guy: What are you doing? Screech J.U.N.K. I\'m pulling this Junk. Sniff... sniff... NOOO! What is it!!! Well it\'s old sneakers mixed in some rotten eggs with stinkbug juice and just a hint of skunk fumes!!! I see... Bye, crap man! Bonk! To be continued','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1580,1,1),(14,14,NULL,NULL,'014_dweeb.png','Dweeb','Why did you hit me on the head? I thought you were a pokemon. Are you blind?! Yes! Then you\'re a D-W-E-E-B. What? DWEEB! I guess he is deaf too! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1735,1,1),(15,15,NULL,NULL,'015_oh_gawd_pkmn.png','Oh Gawd... Pkmn','Magi Yeah! Blah! Blah! Karp Meanwhile... Pkmn Gym I\'ll go in I\'ll battle you! Okay. Go, Unown! Go, Karp! Magi! NO!!! Go, Lugia! Go, Oddish Odd. Not again!!! Go Ho-oh! Go Hamer! Ditto! Stop being a snowman! Dit Fire Blast! Rip Congratulations! Waaahh! Fart Fart The best Pokemon... LOST! Throw! Sorry, did I crack the comic? The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1531,1,1),(16,16,NULL,NULL,'016_cheap_choppers.png','Cheap Choppers','I need some new scissors. Cheap Choppers!!!!!!! Meanwhile... Haha! I am the evil scientist behind Cheap Choppers! Those Cheap Choppers actually have GOLD in them! Now we\'ll see who gets picked last in baseball!!!!! Man, these are cheap! ...But they still chop! How\'s the new disco club? It\'s going rather well... Flash! Huh? Cheap Choppers! Only 99c! (a pack!) Your friends will be so jealous! I gotta git goin\'. Wait! Funny Guy Map A line! Cheap Choppers here! 2 hours Haha! I am the Evil Scientist! Phoop! I\'ll get you again! Phoop! Now I\'ll get you! Phoop! He\'s right behind you! Slam! You goose! You broke the screen! You\'re the goose! Zap! Backfired! Cheap Choppers, go! Slice! Ka-boom! The Cheap-Chopper Sword! To be continued','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1326,1,1),(17,17,NULL,NULL,'017_steves_birthday_party.png','Steve\'s Birthday Party','I got to get this present to Steven! What is it? Steven this is not your present. I will get him a better present. Slam! 99c Cheap Choppers! I got him some Cheap Choppers! Now I must wrap them! I\'m done! Red Lion Bowling Stevn\'s Super Cool Birthday Party! Pat Adam Steven What took ya! Yeah, dude! 2 hours! Yes, PRESENTS! Cheap Choppers! Welp, I gotta get back to Pokemon training... ...Lugia\'s pretty sad... You locked me in! The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,509,1,1),(18,18,NULL,NULL,'018_cheap_choppers_2.png','Cheap Choppers 2','I\'m toast dude! Evil Scientist But I\'m not out! Flip What is this? Bag o\' Stuff This Christmas Tree is too little. Huh? Where are my Cheap Choppers? My Cheap Choppers! How can I go to bed without them?! Now we\'ll see who gets picked last in baseball! Fart Is it just me or is the ground shaking? Crack! Slam! You dork! Bonk! Whoops! Slam Potty-P Closed Moved to Wedgie Town This is the way to get there Fart Bonk! Yes! Wedgie Town Potty-P Free Choppers Yes! Bye! Free Choppers To Funnytown! AAAH! Welcome Chopper Fans Evil Lab! Scientists No farting Fart You farted, weak glass! Welcome Funny Guy Fans! Super Funny Guy! The End','I had to point out the Evil Scientist in the first frame because readers thought it was Funny Guy. Whatever.','Adam, Pat',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,982,1,1),(19,19,NULL,NULL,'019_gas.png','Gas','Ahh','NULL','Adam, Pat',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,803,1,1),(20,20,NULL,NULL,'020_barney.png','Barney','Hi Kids, I\'m STUPID! Piece of JUNK! Slam! Hey, you killed Barney! Ka-boom! Well, he was pretty dumb anyway! Dead Barney Sizzle yeah! I\'m the ghost Barney! You\'re as stupid as the real Barney!!! Squash! Duh, I wouldn\'t be dumb even if I was real. Well you\'re dumb anyway! Slam! Ka-boom! Joy to the world that Barney\'s dead! We barbecued his head! What happened to his body? We flushed it down the potty! Yes! Ka-boom The technical world for fart is gaseous odorous The End','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,683,1,1),(21,21,NULL,NULL,'021_dna.png','DNA','I gotta get to Potty-P\'s Boing! Slam! I\'m here! HI! Want some Poo Cake? New! \'Course! Munch','NULL','Adam, Pat',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,965,1,1),(22,22,NULL,NULL,'022_jungle_adventure.png','Jungle Adventure','Pack me 1000 poo-cakes! Here. Yes! Who are you? Club. Me Cave-man. Bonk! Punch! Fart Power! Fart! FART! This looks like a luxury! Funny Guy House He was unpacking... Done! Potty-P! POTTY-P\'s Want pee soda! Here you go! Glug-glug Spit NO! Stick Attack! Who wants some? My head feels empty AMAZON RIVER Time for a bath! Yeeowch! Piranhas! Where am I? Evil Scientist With my rader... ...I will find the Funny Guy! Will the Evil Scientist find Funny Guy? To be continued on Funny Guy 23 Da, da, duuuh! Please WAIT!! (A couple hours)','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1209,1,1),(23,23,NULL,NULL,'023_coconuts.png','Coconuts','I have located him! Evil Scientist Run! Slam! Meanwhile... It took me 12 hours to get them down! Whaah! Whaahh! I\'m scared! See what I mean? Oh well... Cheap Chopper Sword! Slam! It\'s raining. Funny Guy House I\'m... home. SFG Poo Cookies Salt and Pee Chips (The TV) Ed, Edd, & Eddy Hee-hee! I\'m sleeply. Yes! GO! My best plan yet! It is... ...this! Back at the house... I\'m outside! Fart KA-BOOM! Owww! BURP! Evil Scientist Lab Fart KA-BOOM! Back to the drawing board! BURP! KA-BOOM! Again! Ha ha! I got you! Now I will turn you not-funny! Funny Low High Hyper NO! Yes! To be continued on next page!','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1187,1,1),(24,24,NULL,NULL,'024_koven.png','Koven','Evil Scientist Lab Earth Back on Earth... FART! I\'m out! Dive Hello, Fishy! Bye, fishy! A hot dog? Zzaapp!! Duuuhh! Farrrt! I gotta get to... Potty-P\'s! Time to get coconuts! Grab! Ahh! Oww! Clunk! KA-BOOM! Owww, my butt smarts! I remember! Ahh! NO! Screech! BANG! POTTY-P\'s Hello! Try our very new, Vomit Pizza! I\'ll take it! Chomp MMM... DASH! At the lab... Chika chika Something I just discovered... pizza! In the house... A great view! Helllp! Spplat! FART! Hee-hee! Kevin Piece of junk! SLAM!! FART Yeah! KA-BOOM Kevin Ferocious alligator I\'m scared! Magikarp KEVIN THE END','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1171,1,1),(25,25,NULL,NULL,'025_hyper_day.png','Hyper Day','I\'m hyper today Fart ZAP! See what I mean? Fart That felt good crack Where\'s Potty-P? Yes! POTTY-P\'s Flash! Crap crayons! From Stuff Inc. I have to get Crap Crayons! He is going to a new house and bar','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1531,1,1),(26,26,NULL,NULL,'026_dead_koven.png','Dead Koven','I need to get to the top of the forest! BOING! Splat! Got Duct Tape? Where am I? At the lab','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2000-09-01 00:00:00',900,1075,1,1),(27,27,NULL,NULL,'027_dork_inc.png','Dork Inc.','You fell in a hole! Koven He killed up the hole','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,444,1,1),(28,28,NULL,NULL,'028_crushed.png','Crushed','Yes! Waah! Ooops! Happy shark SPIT! Big Crusher Thingy 2001 Control Room Crunch! SPIKE! Somthin\'s up my butt KA-BOOM! PUNCH! Scoreboard Koven -100 Funny Guy 1000 This won\'t end well. FART Mega Unown SMASHER The End','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,859,1,1),(29,29,NULL,NULL,'029_groundhog_day.png','Groundhog Day','Man, it\'s HOT! What was that? Diglett OWWW! MOMMY! ? Hey! Oh, it\'s REALLY HOT! FAR AWAY','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,868,1,1),(30,30,NULL,NULL,'030_sunglasses_so_cool_they_kill_you.png','Sunglasses So Cool They Kill You','Xtra!!! Potty-P\'s Ultimate PARTY! Yes! Kevin\'s gone! Potty-P\'s Hotel I have plenty of Crap Cooler Want some? As long as it has extra crap in it! Sluurp! Come \'ere. Use this. Elevator Crapitronics This is perfect! FART Hyper Beam! Here we go','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1227,1,1),(31,31,NULL,NULL,'031_fungus_force_field.png','Fungus Force Field','Now to kill Koven! I can\'t get it out! Let me help you','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1255,1,1),(32,32,NULL,NULL,'032_the_war.png','The War','Evil Scientist\'s Lab Note: Big laser on roof. This will work! Uka-Uka It\'s about time you did somethin\' right! Kevin\'s Team Koven Kevin Repair Man Man Man Funny Guy\'s Team Hyper Funny Guy Potty-P Evil Scientist The Monkey Let the battle BEGIN! FART Pow! Oh brother! Big Boy We Stink Dork Attack! Fart Blast! FART We rule! Help! Burp Bubbles! I\'ll give ya a wedgie! Slam! Health check! Koven Kevin Repair M.M.M. Hyper Funny Guy Potty-P What?!? A recovery? Oh, Kevin\'s Alive! Huh? Funny Guy WINS! Frozen Pee Tundra? Wow... What will his new adventure be? Take a look at the next episode! The End','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1253,1,1),(33,33,NULL,NULL,'033_yellow_snow.png','Yellow Snow','Yellow snow! Chomp! Auxi-Moron Chocolate Spray Ssss','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1183,1,1),(34,34,NULL,NULL,'034_sharpeye.png','Sharpeye','Wanna race? Potty-P Yeah! Fart Speed! Fart Cool! Flip! The finish line! Finish The Gas Cup! Welcome to Barney BBQ Wanna BBQ Barney\'s head? Sure! Introducing Auxi Moron Coats! They\'re so warm they\'re like a toaster! See? Let\'s celebrate! Why? I won the race! Let\'s celebrate! Why? I won the race! Let\'s celebrate! Pant Pant... WANT CELEBRATE! Oh well... I\'ll try this again! Splat! Mommy Sharpeye Funny Guy! I\'m going home. I won the game! Level 1 A Rattata! Pokeballs, go! I caught a rattata! Guess what? What? I score a goal! I gotta get home!  4:19 PM 7:41 PM That morning... 1:15 AM Heehee ? Closed Potty-P ONLY FART BEEP BEEP Fire alarm Police Fire Engine Will Funny Guy be considered guilty for putting Potty-P\'s on fire? Next time in: COURT! The End','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1175,1,1),(35,35,NULL,NULL,'035_court.png','Court','I am Judge Poopy. Koven BOOOO! And Funny Guy YAAAY! Order in the court! Crack Funny Guy has','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1175,1,1),(36,36,NULL,NULL,'036_the_brothers.png','The Brothers','Your pits stink! They do? Sniff sniff Potty-P\'s Hi! Why do my pits stink? Cause you eat pizza! Poo-Paint! Add to your collection of: Cheap Choppers Pee Pencils Crap Crayons Poo-Paint! A line! 2 hours Yeah! Now I have','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1180,1,1),(37,37,NULL,NULL,'037_they_meet_again.png','They Meet Again','I got to get dressed! LATER','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,442,1,1),(38,38,NULL,NULL,'038_the_diamond_sword.png','The Diamond Sword','Clash! Yes! Meanwhile','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1182,1,1),(39,39,NULL,NULL,'039_cut_the_cheese.png','Cut the Cheese','If you zap me... Big Zap You\'ll be a big fat rat! So, I\'m a big fat rat! Ah, have some cheese rat! Splat! Is this thing loaded? My head\'s stick! Pow! Now what? Hey, I\'m over here! Uh... To my left, uh to your left, uh... other left... no, not go right, correct! It\'s not a soccer game, use your brain! Well I guess that\'s over here, well... owch! Just bend down right... He shoots he scores! 2 hours... Block! Koven\'s origin Funny Guy read... Koven used to be a really smart person. 1st Kevman 2nd Kev 3rd Kevin 4th Koven Bookshelf Stomp Now we\'ll see who gets picked last in baseball! See ya! Yum yum eat him up! KA-BOOM Hologram Evil Scientist Well, well, well... If it isn\'t Funny Guy... Welcome. We have to foil Koven\'s plans again... using gems, crystals, and relics. See you... O.K. The End','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1184,1,1),(40,40,NULL,NULL,'040_skits.png','Skits','Ooo! Pretty! F.G. Backpack What?!?! Ultra Funny Guy Psy Funny Guy! That was in the sewer... Yum, yum, eat him up! I\'m going to Disney World! Yikes! Splat! FOOOOOD FIIIGHHT! WAHAHAHA! Crystal! Time 00:10:56 Aah! Close yeah! Koven at home New remote inside cut cut My remote! Punch! Great Barney Mask! AW! C\'mon! Splat! Eeetug, eee pull! Hey Bro! Wanna relax? \'Course? Hi! Two Pee-Sodas! An apple tree! Slurp! 2 hours... What did you with these apples? Park Ranger Don\'t ask me, I have them a good licking and sent them home. Koven Paper Eee tug, eee pull! I don\'t wanna be \'Psy\' Funny Guy... Ultra F.G. Time! Cheap Choppers! Blub blub Repair Man! RM Stick Attack! Who will win the next battle? Tune into: Funny Guy Underwater','NULL','NULL',NULL,'2001-01-01 00:00:00',900,1182,1,1),(41,41,NULL,NULL,'041_funny_guy_jr.png','Funny Guy Jr.','Oh, yeah! Huh? Mayor\'s Office hello? I love you, you love me! I don\'t like that song! Koven I\'ll repair Koven! I am a woodpecker! He is just a baby! Funny Guy Jr. So me a baby! And now a word from Auxi-Moron When you\'re sittin\' on the john, and the toilet paper\'s gone... be a man, use your hand! Anyway... If you can\'t afford toilet paper, buy Auxi-Moron Used Toilet Paper! And it comes in 