.. twitch GRAAAGH! Snowplow! Brmm NOOO! szzzzz Foom Cotton! Snargurgle! Crak! Oookay... Running time! Thawk! Owcherz wrap Noo! ...bubble... Haha! clik clik Shotgun-whipped! How do you fire a gun with mittens, anyway? Meanwhile... Hybrid Hammer! Fwoosh To be continued!','Halo-influenced. Had a lot of fun drawing this.','Adam',3,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1204,8,1),(323,305,NULL,NULL,'305_share_this_kare_bears.png','Share This, Kare Bears!','Hybrid Hammer! Bong! Dissolve! Meanwhile','NULL','Adam',3,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1200,8,1),(324,306,NULL,NULL,'306_halo_237.png','Halo 237','Finally, I\'ve been hunting this one all DAY! Where did you get to little buddy','NULL','Oliver',3,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1184,8,1),(325,307,NULL,NULL,'307_kare_bear_fun.png','Kare Bear Fun!','Kare Bear Fun! Aha ha ha HA chk chk I know','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,539,8,1),(326,308,NULL,NULL,'308_dinger.png','Dinger','C\'mon Jr., let\'s go play some baseball Oh Jr., pitch the ball! crack THE END! ','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,435,8,1),(327,309,NULL,NULL,'309_splinter_guy.png','Splinter Guy','Jr.! Where are you Jr.? Jr.? Jr.? Are you back there Jr.? Ahhh! YA! yes, direct hit! Jr., you\'re a dead man! Uh-oh. Huh? Now where did he go? THE END','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,424,8,1),(328,310,NULL,NULL,'310_the_russian_bear_factory.png','The Russian Bear Factory','C\'mon Jr. we gotta go. The Kare Bears have built the ultimate Kare Bear in the Build-Uh-Bear Workshop in Russia. That\'s where we need to go! Now where can that workshop be? BUILD UH BEAR Maybe it\'s that big place that says','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1071,8,1),(329,311,NULL,NULL,'311_reverse_psychology.png','Reverse Psychology','CONTINUED Ahh! Ahh! BLAM Ahh die die die! Chk chk Ah die die Ahh! AHH! AH AHAH! BAM! Heavy breathing Oh poo! AHHH! Ahh! ROOF Roar BUILD-UH-BEAR MEANWHILE Seems like an ordinary office to me. Hmm, what\'s this? Oh a joystick thingy! Please do not touch because this is not the remote that controls the ultimate bear. I wonder what it does! Click Ahh! Roar! What the? BEEP BEEP BEEP Click move Donk Boring UH OH! Disassembly Room Arrrrrrggh! Yes! You may have beaten my creation, Funny Guy! Huh? But you\'ll never defeat ME! Ahahahahaha! Cussles To be continued','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1181,8,1),(330,312,NULL,NULL,'312_interrogation.png','Interrogation','','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1185,8,1),(331,313,NULL,NULL,'313_rollin_away.png','Rollin\' Away','Ahh! You will be mine! Ah! Come here! Crack I\'ve lost him. Whoa weeee yes! Uh oh! Yes! Spring No! No ah! Ahh! Splash! You may not know where I sleep at night, but I know where you will be for a long time. Here! JAIL The End!','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1183,8,1),(332,314,NULL,NULL,'314_something_more.png','Something More','One day, while Target was playing PS2','NULL','Oliver',3,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1050,8,1),(333,315,NULL,NULL,'315_total_recall.png','Total Recall','Boof! GUTZ! Cotton Puffy! No! Yes! No! Go away! Ahh! Ahhh! LATER','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,953,8,1),(334,316,NULL,NULL,'316_xbox_live.png','Xbox Live','L.A.N. Party! DuDuDuDuDu, POW, Pheeew, Perchchch, dududu, dududu Hey, what, doubleh... GAME OVER Yes! Take that Target! Hey guys, I\'m back! Oh, the game\'s over? Hey! Who killed me? New game guys? Okay? UH UH, nope! No! No way. How about Splinter Cell? Alright but we\'re playin\' on Live! Fine with me. And me! Uh, me too. Splinter Cell: Destruction Hypothesis Let\'s make a Chinese game and invite Chinese people! Whatever! Game Options: DM Game Settings: A Map: The Alley GAME NAME: ChinSapWah DEATHMATCH! NinjaMan08 Joined Look, someone joined! POP Hello do you speak English? Un poy da pun de hunsa. AHHHHHHHHHhhhhhhh! Ah, what does ah mean? It means I fall off edge you stupid American. 5 Hours Later... Let\'s do it again! Element, we\'ve been inviting foreign people to our games and booting them right back out for 5 HOURS! Besides, there\'s no more countries in the encyclopedia... So what\'d\'ya wanna do? I\'m goin\' outside. Me too. Wait up! Fine, see ya. Hey We missed Liberia! The End ','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1049,8,1),(335,317,NULL,NULL,'317_4th_of_july_special.png','4th of July Special','This 4th of July, we had fun playing Halo!! But we\'re going to show you some of our classic 4th of July moments... here they are. FADE Hey Target have you seen Junior anywhere? No, wh- Tank sound Junior? Look guys, the 4th of July Tank! Junior died Hahahahaha! Hey guys! Junior, what\'s that glowing thing on your leg? Huh? Where? Junior died Element died Target died I got the flag! I got the flag! I got the flag! Ahh! Junior was stuck by Target! I got the flag again! I got the flag again! I got the flag again! Vvvroooom I got the... hey what\'s that noise? Junior was splattered by Target I got the bomb! I got the bomb! I got the bomb! I got the- Pow! Junior was sniped by Element Okay Repair Man, when I go, you run in and grab the flag. Got it! 3, 2, 1... POW Repair Man was sniped by Target Go! Repair Man? Junior was sniped by Element THE GRAND FINALE! Junior was stuck by Target And there you have it, our greatest 4th of July moments. Happy 4th of July! The End ','NULL','Oliver',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1223,8,1),(336,318,NULL,NULL,'318_gutterball.png','Gutterball','Today Junior, we get to go bowling! Oh boy! BOWLING This place is sweet! Let\'s get started! 1 Game and 7 Gutterballs Later... Nice try Junior. Play again!? Why not! Phew. Weeee! 5 minutes later... Ping! POING! Chk chk BLAM! Tsssssss TOPPLE SMACK ZZT CLICK ZZT Yes, strike! Yes Junior, nice shot, um, I mean bowl, nice bowl! I guess it\'s my turn. Oh boy, special pins, if I knock all these down I get free pizza! This should be fairly simple becase I\'ve gotten a strike on every other bowl. Ahh! Later... You got hit in the head by a bowling pin, but don\'t worry, I bowled for you. You got all 0\'s, I got strikes. The End','NULL','Oliver',3,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1185,8,1),(337,319,NULL,NULL,'319_theme_park.png','Theme Park','Car!...I hate...jewelry!... Only... 29-999995... Stupid tst tst tst tst chk We really need to do something different for once... In other news, Thrillz Theme Park is having its rides inspected today following a strange roller coaster accident... HEY! Flash There could be thousands of people in danger there! Or it could be that I need something to do. C\'mon Olymp and Junior! We\'re goin\' in! Later!!! Thuppathuppa We\'re goin\' in! Chong Shing Woosh Let\'s go. Wham Hey... This ain\'t no theme park! That\'s right... Serious Man. It\'s time for another battle! The Good Team! Elemental Funny Guy! Funny Guy Junior! Razor Funny Guy! Target Funny Guy! Must... need... ammo... (clips) Olympian Funny Guy! The Evil Team! Serious Man! Mr. Evil! Mini-Mi! Mr. It! Koven! Duuuhh... My head feels empty! ...and Repair Man! GO! Battle! Grrrr... Ai Ai Ai Ai Ai Ai Ai! Razor used spike cannon! Chang (Nachos) Not again! Tortilla\'d! To be continued','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1221,8,1),(338,320,NULL,NULL,'320_doritos.png','Doritos','Owchies! Yer goin\' down, sucka! (Doritos) Thoom thoom thoom thoom NOOOO! Woosh (Wait...) Yum! Chomp! Shoulda known... Substitution! Junior + Element for Razor Here you go, guys! (Anti-Anti Monster Potion) Slurrp Shatter Bubble ? Nothing happened! It says \'Expires once in contact with overused joke.\' ','NULL','Adam',NULL,'2005-01-01 00:00:00',900,1225,8,1);
